# Product registration order

**최신등록순** sorts by `product.registeredAt` (ISO), newest first.

Applies to:

- Shop / Collection filters (every category and subcategory)
- Homepage category rails under each lookbook banner (top-left = newest)
- Any new product listing UI — always `sortProducts(list, "new")` before slicing

When adding products:

1. Set `registeredAt` to the registration time, e.g. `new Date().toISOString()`.
2. Prefer appending new SKUs to the hand-authored catalogue.
3. Do not leave new products without `registeredAt` if they must appear above older stock.
4. Collection filler SKUs (`briq-col-*`) keep older dates on purpose.
5. Set `editTier` when the product should land in a specific 100 Collection bucket:
   - `"signature"` — 하이엔드 / 100만 원 이상 대표 라인
   - `"bestseller"` — 입문·데일리 / 첫 구매 전환 구간
   - `"new"` — 신상품·시즌 기획
   If omitted, the site infers from price / badge / recency (`src/lib/collection-edit.ts`).
